Package: claude-conversation-search
Version: 0.0.0-replaced-by-makefile
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: replaced-by-makefile
Maintainer: Jérôme Poulin <jeromepoulin@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ticpu/claude-conversation-search-mcp
Description: Full-text search over Claude Code conversation history
 Indexes the JSONL transcripts Claude Code writes under ~/.claude/projects
 with Tantivy and searches them by BM25 relevance, with grep-style -A/-B/-C
 context around each match, tag and project filters, and date ranges. The
 same binary runs as an MCP server, which lets Claude search its own past
 sessions during a conversation. Ships bash, zsh and fish completions.
